  "verified_behaviors": [
    "Metadata-only restore verifies pinned current/retained generations, checksums and schema before one publication CAS.",
    "A fixed operation deadline covers renewal stop and ambiguous-publication reconciliation; cleanup retains custody until actual quiescence.",
    "Partial opens, stalled renewal, delayed client Close, exhausted verification budget and lease loss preserve ownership and outcome.",
    "CLI outcomes retain not_attempted, not_published, verified_noop, target_observed and unknown while suppressing provider diagnostics.",
    "Four real TLS subprocesses cover single-to-single, single-to-two-parts, two-parts-to-single and verified no-op; complete committed metadata is compared independently.",
    "Existing native worker and authenticated query containment gates pass with exact child/outer terminals and graceful broker cleanup."
  ],
